<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Fireball</h1>
<p>Sphere: Fire Sphere
Spell Tier: 2
Class: Sorcerer (guild level 14)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast fireball &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast fireball</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>A compact ball of fire forms before the caster and flies at the target. 
The better your magic and your fire sphere, the more it burns. Fire does 
best against clothes and light leather and much less against chain and 
plate, and a shield can block it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It can be cast while fighting, 
and no free hands are needed. It is also found on wands, staffs and 
scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
